## Report

**Implementation commit:** `0284b5a` — `feat: render home carousel through the KiddOS UI library` (single focused source commit; no milestone-runner files or logs included)

**Files changed (15):**
- New: `include/kiddos/app/home_carousel_screen.hpp`, `src/app/home_carousel_screen.cpp` — `HomeCarouselScreen` derived from `ui::Screen`, built from `Container`/`Panel`/`Image` plus an app-local status-indicator element (uses only `ui::Renderer` primitives). It mirrors `SDLPlatform::draw_carousel` exactly: side cards `{25,250,190,175}` / `{505,250,190,175}`, center card `{145,135,430,370}` with outer glow outline, artwork rects (`80×90` sides at opacity 180, `200×205` center), title rect `{220,525,280,42}` shown only for the middle game, and the speaker/battery status coordinates and colors. Neighbors are added before the center card so the center overlaps them, and the same wrap-around neighbor mapping (`left = (sel+2)%3`, `right = (sel+1)%3`) is used. Reuses the existing generated BMP artwork (magenta-keyed).
- New: `include/kiddos/app/ui_action_mapping.hpp` — maps platform `Action` → `ui::UIAction` (`NavigateLeft→Left`, …, `None`/`Quit` → `nullopt`).
- Modified: `src/app/application.cpp`, `include/kiddos/app/application.hpp` — `ScreenManager` + non-owning `ui::Renderer` attached to `platform.native_renderer()` (no second SDL renderer); home screen pushed after init, rendered via `screens_.render()`; screens cleared before `platform_.shutdown()`; `IMG_Init`/`IMG_Quit` per the UI-library docs. Navigation/wrap, Confirm-opens-action-screen, and Back-closes-it behavior preserved (Back deliberately never reaches `ScreenManager`, which would pop the home screen). The game-action screen stays on the manual `draw_game_actions` path.
- Modified: `kiddos/ui/texture.{hpp,cpp}` — optional `magenta_key` color-key flag on `Texture::load` (required for the existing magenta-background artwork; default parameter keeps existing callers compatible).
- Modified: `platform/platform.hpp`, `platform/sdl_platform.hpp` — `native_renderer()` accessor (forward-declared `SDL_Renderer` so `Platform` consumers don't need SDL headers).
- New tests: `tests/app_ui_action_mapping_test.cpp`, `tests/app_home_carousel_screen_test.cpp` (structure/geometry/visibility without a renderer, plus software-renderer pixel checks of card fills, artwork presence, selection changes, and title visibility).
- CMake and doc updates (`KID_MODE_CAROUSEL_PROTOTYPE.md`, `ui-image-support.md`, `DEVELOPMENT_LOG.md`).

**Build:** success. Remaining compiler warnings are pre-existing (`sdl_platform.cpp` multichar/unused-function warnings, untouched).

**Tests:** 26/26 passed (`ctest --test-dir build`), including the 2 new tests and all pre-existing ones (none weakened). Also ran a 5-second headless smoke run (`SDL_VIDEODRIVER=dummy`) without a crash.

**Limitations / for your review:**
- **Visual approval is yours to give** — please run `./build/kiddos` from the repo root and inspect. The corner rasterization of the UI library's rounded-fill differs from the platform's helper by at most ~1 px on corner arcs (slightly different inset math); card fills, artwork, title, and status indicators were verified by pixel tests.
- `SDLPlatform::draw_carousel` and its platform-owned carousel/title textures are now unused for the home screen but intentionally left in place (the artwork textures are still used by the manual action screen); they can be removed in a later cleanup.
- Textures are loaded by the screen from the same paths relative to the process working directory, matching the existing application convention (the app must still be launched from the repo root).
